[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2941.27, "timestamp": "00:49:01", "text": "因为皮下没问题，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2947.51, "timestamp": "00:49:07", "text": "但为了再次确认，我问了我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2949.03, "timestamp": "00:49:09", "text": "妈妈。我心想：“好吧，我还能吃吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2950.71, "timestamp": "00:49:10", "text": "他们？”我妈第一反应就是尖叫。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2953.23, "timestamp": "00:49:13", "text": "他对我说：“呃，这他妈是什么玩意儿？”以及"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2955.589, "timestamp": "00:49:15", "text": "第二秒她就说：“不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2957.829, "timestamp": "00:49:17", "text": "你不能吃它们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2959.43, "timestamp": "00:49:19", "text": "它们上面长霉了。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2961.99, "timestamp": "00:49:21", "text": "不能吃。我的天啊。我当时就想，为什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2966.15, "timestamp": "00:49:26", "text": "尽管？里面看起来不错。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2968.71, "timestamp": "00:49:28", "text": "所以，这就是她这么说的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2971.829, "timestamp": "00:49:31", "text": "她说：“你23岁了。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2977.51, "timestamp": "00:49:37", "text": "蠢吗？我的聊天记录显示：“你不蠢。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2983.589, "timestamp": "00:49:43", "text": "橙色。”我有时会看到阿斯彭说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2986.95, "timestamp": "00:49:46", "text": "有些事我会想，“啊，我做过这件事。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2988.15, "timestamp": "00:49:48", "text": "这就是关键所在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2990.069, "timestamp": "00:49:50", "text": "有时候就像我说“我做”的时候那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2993.15, "timestamp": "00:49:53", "text": "我当时就想，哦不哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2996.39, "timestamp": "00:49:56", "text": "与阿斯彭的寒冷无关，这不是好事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2998.15, "timestamp": "00:49:58", "text": "事物。"}]